- [ ] Mobile surfaces remain mobile web; no fabricated native-app tab bar/chatbot.
- [ ] FigureViewer returns to the immediate prior context and restores focus.
- [ ] Technical thread images follow the separate canonical image handoff.
- [ ] Actual current MDX/spec/evidence wins over text shown inside any generated mockup.

