271:<Term id="skillbom">**SkillBOM**</Term> already appears in research on skill identity, dependencies and run provenance.[^skillbom] Here it names this implementation's manifest for recording artifact composition and provenance. The useful question is which relationships it preserves. A manifest produced while assembling a bundle can identify the assembled artifacts without proving that a later session loaded them. A run record has to bind that use separately.
